{"due_when": {"check_every_days": 3, "clears_when": "BOTH, and they are different facts - say WHICH you cleared. (1) The un-carried-spec COUNT is MEASURED and reported with a stated classifier and a positive control (WO-20260906-COUNT-THE-UN-CARRIED-SPECS). Until then nobody knows whether the 14-day case was a one-off or a population. (2) A MECHANISM makes an un-carried spec visible WITHOUT a session thinking of it - see BL-20260906-A-RESEARCH-ARTIFACT-THAT-SPECIFIES-WORK-IS-NOT-REGISTERED-AS-WORK - and it has been run over the EXISTING tree, not only armed for new artifacts. !! DO NOT CLEAR BECAUSE A SESSION IS RUNNING. A session being spawned is exactly the state that looked fine on 2026-08-23. !! DO NOT CLEAR ON ANOTHER MEMO. The failure class is a well-written artifact nothing points at; an eighth document restating the diagnosis makes this row MORE true. !! IF THE OPERATOR DECIDES the count is not worth measuring, this row does not clear - it CHANGES: that is a legitimate decision and must be RECORDED as one rather than left looking like work about to start.", "kind": "observation", "last_checked": "2026-09-12"}, "id": "OI-20260906-RESEARCH-THAT-SPECIFIES-WORK-IS-CARRIED-BY-NOTHING", "next_action": "check_observation", "origin": {"kind": "audit", "ref": "docs/archive/2026-09-21-operating-reset/registers/OPEN-ITEMS.json#OI-20260906-RESEARCH-THAT-SPECIFIES-WORK-IS-CARRIED-BY-NOTHING", "rerun": "python3 -c \"import json; d=json.load(open('docs/archive/2026-09-21-operating-reset/registers/OPEN-ITEMS.json')); items=d['items'] if isinstance(d, dict) else d; print(json.dumps(next(i for i in items if i.get('id')=='OI-20260906-RESEARCH-THAT-SPECIFIES-WORK-IS-CARRIED-BY-NOTHING'), indent=2))\""}, "state": "queued", "what": "[LOUD] A finished, operator-directive-carrying session prompt sat undispatched 14 days; the thesis was re-derived seven times and built zero"}
{"due_when": {"check_every_days": 3, "clears_when": "A bybit_coverage_soak row is OBSERVED on bybit_1 carrying verdicts_differ: true -- read off the live diag surface (/api/diag/log_file?name=bybit_coverage_soak), not from a test fixture. !! A GREEN TEST SUITE CLEARS NOTHING HERE: #10746 carries 623 lines of re-armed unit tests and none of them is a live row. !! NOR DOES ELAPSED TIME: this row's check_every_days governs how often a session must LOOK, never when the soak may be declared finished. !! AND AN EMPTY LOG IS NOT A NEGATIVE until the arm has been read back off /proc/<MainPID>/environ -- before that, zero rows means the gate is off, which is the state it is deliberately in. If the arm IS confirmed and the log is still empty after a full sweep cycle, that is the OPPOSITE finding -- the writer is not writing -- and it clears this row into a defect, not into a pass.", "kind": "observation", "last_checked": "2026-09-17"}, "id": "OI-20260902-BYBIT-GRADED-COVERAGE-SOAK-IS-THE-ONLY-EVIDENCE-FOR-WIDENING-AND-NOTHING-WATCHES-IT", "next_action": "check_observation", "origin": {"kind": "audit", "ref": "docs/archive/2026-09-21-operating-reset/registers/OPEN-ITEMS.json#OI-20260902-BYBIT-GRADED-COVERAGE-SOAK-IS-THE-ONLY-EVIDENCE-FOR-WIDENING-AND-NOTHING-WATCHES-IT", "rerun": "python3 -c \"import json; d=json.load(open('docs/archive/2026-09-21-operating-reset/registers/OPEN-ITEMS.json')); items=d['items'] if isinstance(d, dict) else d; print(json.dumps(next(i for i in items if i.get('id')=='OI-20260902-BYBIT-GRADED-COVERAGE-SOAK-IS-THE-ONLY-EVIDENCE-FOR-WIDENING-AND-NOTHING-WATCHES-IT'), indent=2))\""}, "state": "queued", "what": "[LOUD] #10746 ships a soak at runtime_logs/bybit_coverage_soak.jsonl whose rows are the ONLY declared evidence for the operator's conditional widening of the graded-coverage gate to bybit_portfolio and then bybit_2 (REAL MONEY) -- and until this row, that soak was registered NOWHERE. The PR proposes a health-review-backlog row instead, and the backlog is NOT a due-list source (scripts/ops/render_due_list.py::SOURCES reads open_items, operator_owed, research_queue, probes, red_crons, unlanded_automation -- no backlog). So the soak would have accrued, or failed to accrue, and surfaced to nobody."}
{"due_when": {"check_every_days": 7, "clears_when": "The operator records a decision on §4A of docs/design/evidence-floor-horizon-PROPOSAL.md — either the packet reports real and paper as separate populations, or blending is explicitly DECLARED acceptable for this gate and the reason is written down. ⚠️ A MERGED FILTER DOES NOT CLEAR THIS BY ITSELF: the row is about which population the gate DECIDES on, and shipping a filter without the decision recorded would settle it by default. ⚠️ NOR DOES THE FLEET SIMPLY TRADING MORE REAL MONEY — the blend is a property of the query, not of the volume, and it would persist unnoticed at any size.", "kind": "observation", "last_checked": null}, "id": "OI-20260902-STRATEGY-REVIEW-PACKET-BLENDS-REAL-AND-PAPER-PNL", "next_action": "check_observation", "origin": {"kind": "audit", "ref": "docs/archive/2026-09-21-operating-reset/registers/OPEN-ITEMS.json#OI-20260902-STRATEGY-REVIEW-PACKET-BLENDS-REAL-AND-PAPER-PNL", "rerun": "python3 -c \"import json; d=json.load(open('docs/archive/2026-09-21-operating-reset/registers/OPEN-ITEMS.json')); items=d['items'] if isinstance(d, dict) else d; print(json.dumps(next(i for i in items if i.get('id')=='OI-20260902-STRATEGY-REVIEW-PACKET-BLENDS-REAL-AND-PAPER-PNL'), indent=2))\""}, "state": "queued", "what": "[LOUD] [NEVER VERIFIED] scripts/ml/strategy_review_packet.py::pull_decisions filters ONLY is_backtest — it never consults account_class or is_demo — so every M7 review packet and every INDEX row blends real-money and paper PnL, against CLAUDE.md's P4 live-trade-management contract ('real and paper performance are never blended'), which /api/bot/stats, /api/bot/performance, /api/bot/trades/closed and /api/bot/strategy/attribution all honour. ⚠️ THIS CHANGES WHAT THE HEADLINE FINDING MEANS, not just a report's tidiness. The -35,446 of 'provenance-trusted losing pnl that no window could act on' — the measured motivation for widening the evidence floor's window — is essentially all paper. Population: 142 closed non-backtest trades whose order_package.created_at falls inside the 2026-09-01 packet window (2026-08-25T12:03:05Z..2026-09-01T12:03:05Z), read from a 1000-row /api/diag/journal?table=trades page spanning 2026-08-03..2026-09-02 (so the window is fully covered, not truncated), joined to order_packages on order_package_id. Split: PAPER 136 trades / -36,219.07 · REAL MONEY 6 trades / -3.11. The entire real-money population is 6 closed trades on bybit_2 across 2 legs (ict_scalp_5m x5, trend_donchian_xrp_4h x1). And 59.4% of the -35,446 is ONE leg with ONE closed trade: ict_scalp_mgc_15m at -21,070.00, verified against the journal as trade 5259 on ib_paper (MGC long 4454.8 -> 4405.8, 43 contracts, sl_cross; -49.0 points x 43 x the 10oz multiplier = -21,070.00 exactly, so the arithmetic is CORRECT — it is the account class, not the number, that is the finding)."}
