 i.get('id')=='BL-20260912-THE-DEPRECATED-3-ARG-GIT-MERGE-TREE-REPORTS-A-CLEAN-MERGE-FOR-A-PAIR-THAT-REALLY-CONFLICTS'), indent=2))\""}, "state": "queued", "what": "[health] `git merge-tree <base> <ours> <theirs>` (the deprecated 3-arg form) reports ZERO conflict markers for a ref pair that git's own `git merge`, `merge-tree --write-tree` and GitHub all grade as conflicting — so a session using it as a cheap mergeability probe reports a false all-clear"}
