e` account and the deleted fallback covered 0 of them. [!] WHAT IS NOT YET ESTABLISHED, and is the whole point of this row: the live trader is a long-running process whose `STRATEGIES` is evaluated ONCE at import, so NONE of this reaches production until ict-trader-live is RESTARTED after the deploy. ict-git-sync pulls main every ~5 min but does not restart the trader. So `merged` will be true and `deployed` false for an unbounded window, and `observed` needs a third fact on top of that.", "why_it_matters": "The defect being fixed is an exit-path outage on a live real-money system that presents as `7/7 checks ok`. A fix for a silent failure that is itself unobserved reproduces the same condition one level up -- this repo's most-paid-for mistake is collapsing merged / deployed / observed."}
