fvg_range are driven entirely by forwarded flags. So the lever map either forwards nothing and trusts the harness's own read (in which case `fidelity` cannot be computed the way the other four compute it), or --ignore-yaml is used and every param is forwarded explicitly. That is a design call, not a mechanical port. turtle_soup is the 9th and has no harness at all in scripts/ -- a separate question, not this one."}
{"due_when": {"check_every_days": 14, "clears_when": "Every comms/strategy_evidence/*.json carries a source_run (and cost_stack.source) that a session with no memory of the producing run can actually reach -- a committed artifact path, a workflow run id, or an explicit 'not durably retrievable: <why>' -- OR the field is documented as deliberately ephemeral with the reason stated in the record.", "kind": "observation"}, "id": "PI-20260922-5GAYXBX5-0002", "next_action": "dispatch_lane", "origin": {"kind": "session", "ref": "session_01Pfa2shVwLhbdof5GayXBX5, checklist row E25, observed while producing comms/strategy_evidence/fvg_range_15m.json", "rerun": "python3 -c \"import json,glob; [print(f, json.load(open(f)).get('source_run')) for f in sorted(glob.glob('comms/strategy_evidence/*.json'))]\"   # every record whose source_run is an unreachable session-local path"}, "state": "queued", "what": "THE EVIDENCE RECORDS' OWN LOCATORS POINT INTO /tmp, WHICH docs/CLAUDE-RULES-CANONICAL.md EXPLICITLY REFUSES. That doc's 'A MEASURED must say WHERE THE MEASUREMENT LIVES' section says a number whose source cannot be found is not MEASURED but INFERRED from an unstated one, and requires either a reachable locator or an explicit 'MEASURED (source not durably retrievable: <why>)'. MEASURED 2026-09-22 by reading the committed records: comms/strategy_evidence/eth_pullback_2h.json and trend_donchian.json (both written by R1's 2026-09-22 corpus re-run) carry source_run '/tmp/tmp.RsNZr5lfkw/<leg>__trades.jsonl', and fvg_range_15m.json written by this session carries '/tmp/claude-0/e25wd/fvg_range_15m__trades.jsonl'; cost_stack.source has the same shape. Those directories do not survive the session that made them, so the per-trade rows behind every pooled net_r_oos -- the numbers scripts/ci/check_roster_promotion_evidence.py grades a real-money roster against -- cannot be re-read or re-audited by anyone. NOT introduced by E25: it is the producer's default (build_strategy_evidence.py: wd =